=== Wisdom leads to Christ
--- Get Wisdom [title]
overline: Wisdom & the fear of the LORD
heading: Get Wisdom
big: Proverbs 4:7 | mark: Wisdom is the principal thing; therefore get wisdom
center: Life is a gift from God, and an abundant life is in service of Him. All wisdom leads to Christ.
